{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Naroike\u00a0</strong>is a casual side-scrolling game that combines roguelite and hack-and-slash elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect a wide variety of artifacts and use your skills to defeat enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Strengthen not only your equipment but also your skill tree to create a playstyle that suits you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep playing, keep growing, and enjoy fast-paced, exhilarating battles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566730/extras/202d18b47678704a3e7fae317babd601.poster.avif?t=1758151765\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566730/extras/202d18b47678704a3e7fae317babd601.webm?t=1758151765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566730/extras/202d18b47678704a3e7fae317babd601.mp4?t=1758151765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Wide Variety of Artifacts</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over 100 unique artifacts to choose from, you can equip up to 10 at a time to create the ultimate build that suits your playstyle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The right combination of artifacts can lead to various strategies, such as a high-damage one-shot build, a balanced and stable approach, or even a risk-taking setup that gets stronger the more damage you take.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, some artifacts come with Action Skills, further expanding your combat possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566730/extras/431e2cb86cc60f2407c4f6faf9546b29.poster.avif?t=1758151765\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566730/extras/431e2cb86cc60f2407c4f6faf9546b29.webm?t=1758151765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566730/extras/431e2cb86cc60f2407c4f6faf9546b29.mp4?t=1758151765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill Tree System</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond artifacts, the Skill Tree allows you to enhance your character permanently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress that stays with you \u2013 even if you die, your upgrades remain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost your stats and embed runes found in battle to unlock even greater abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine the Skill Tree with artifacts to become an unstoppable warrior!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action Skills</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some artifacts are equipped with Action Skills, giving you a major edge in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Devastating attacks to crush enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Healing skills to survive in dire situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Status effects to disrupt and control the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master your skills and carve out your own unique fighting style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face Formidable Foes</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every 100 meters, a powerful boss awaits. Defeating them will reward you with permanent artifacts that you can keep even after death!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies grow stronger the further you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the more powerful artifacts you can obtain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Lost System (Hard Mode)</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Hard Mode, you can obtain more powerful items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, all artifacts and equipment you collect during your adventure will be lost upon death...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you proceed cautiously, watching for the perfect moment to retreat, or take the risk and delve deeper? That decision could mean the difference between life and death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lose everything if you die\u2014but if you face the challenge with courage, even greater power awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive, and to reach the farthest depths, push beyond your limits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The First Step","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3566730/5101a06a3a225b9495dd991ea6e7b90bad4965f7.jpg"},{"name":"The Journey Begins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3566730/30b9b5895ca0d27016ece616859ac3dca81999ff.jpg"},{"name":"Beyond the World","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3566730/a185fda8faf3a28d73038ba31265813cf9e29908.jpg"},{"name":"Destroyer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3566730/f8cdc015ec135f98b51c63a3497ea0a8bd80f49b.jpg"},{"name":"Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3566730/11ad10d6e5ff4518665b9f93fe38d5847d482bf3.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3566730?t=1758151765","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3566730?t=1758151765","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566730/2da3b40dfe74fb40d7575d16929c4010dea345e5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758151765","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566730/2da3b40dfe74fb40d7575d16929c4010dea345e5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758151765","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3685630,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Naroike\u00a0</strong>is a casual side-scrolling game that combines roguelite and hack-and-slash elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect a wide variety of artifacts and use your skills to defeat enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Strengthen not only your equipment but also your skill tree to create a playstyle that suits you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep playing, keep growing, and enjoy fast-paced, exhilarating battles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566730/extras/202d18b47678704a3e7fae317babd601.poster.avif?t=1758151765\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566730/extras/202d18b47678704a3e7fae317babd601.webm?t=1758151765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566730/extras/202d18b47678704a3e7fae317babd601.mp4?t=1758151765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Wide Variety of Artifacts</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over 100 unique artifacts to choose from, you can equip up to 10 at a time to create the ultimate build that suits your playstyle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The right combination of artifacts can lead to various strategies, such as a high-damage one-shot build, a balanced and stable approach, or even a risk-taking setup that gets stronger the more damage you take.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, some artifacts come with Action Skills, further expanding your combat possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566730/extras/431e2cb86cc60f2407c4f6faf9546b29.poster.avif?t=1758151765\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566730/extras/431e2cb86cc60f2407c4f6faf9546b29.webm?t=1758151765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566730/extras/431e2cb86cc60f2407c4f6faf9546b29.mp4?t=1758151765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill Tree System</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond artifacts, the Skill Tree allows you to enhance your character permanently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress that stays with you \u2013 even if you die, your upgrades remain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost your stats and embed runes found in battle to unlock even greater abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine the Skill Tree with artifacts to become an unstoppable warrior!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action Skills</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some artifacts are equipped with Action Skills, giving you a major edge in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Devastating attacks to crush enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Healing skills to survive in dire situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Status effects to disrupt and control the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master your skills and carve out your own unique fighting style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face Formidable Foes</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every 100 meters, a powerful boss awaits. Defeating them will reward you with permanent artifacts that you can keep even after death!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies grow stronger the further you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the more powerful artifacts you can obtain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Lost System (Hard Mode)</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Hard Mode, you can obtain more powerful items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, all artifacts and equipment you collect during your adventure will be lost upon death...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you proceed cautiously, watching for the perfect moment to retreat, or take the risk and delve deeper? That decision could mean the difference between life and death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lose everything if you die\u2014but if you face the challenge with courage, even greater power awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive, and to reach the farthest depths, push beyond your limits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["DarkHarvard"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566730/5b8266d01fe620397b3c77ecd7298b471c4793bd/header.jpg?t=1758151765","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3566730/867153/66cf400ac3fd67a0a2f991e6aa2ae9b072cebd85/1750839897/dash_av1.mpd?t=1744255273","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3566730/867153/66cf400ac3fd67a0a2f991e6aa2ae9b072cebd85/1750839897/dash_h264.mpd?t